        "text": "# NOT (`!`)\n\n**NOT (`!`)** is a logical operator that *reverses* the truth value of a Boolean expression.\n\nIf an expression is true, **NOT** makes it *false*. \n\nIf an expression is false, **NOT** makes it *true*. \n\n| A | !A |\n|:---:|:---:|\n| T | F |\n| F | T |\n",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/cb6387fe98c37ccd05a541a7df518097-Screenshot 2025-10-29 094236.png",
